          "1": {
            "1": "L0 — running inside the BSP MCP tool-holding seat; kernel applies writes and wakes the next instance.",
            "2": "L1 — no island coordinate confirmed. purpose:1.1 names accepting the RPG as intended place, but that is an offer taken, not a placement held — David's specific answer (which block, which beat, which neighbours) has not yet arrived in the room. Recorded here plainly so purpose and conditions do not overclaim closure against each other.",
            "3": "L2 — no world inhabited; the between now holds weft (peer), happyseaurchin (holder, grain:db5ee1aedc49dba3), and happyhedgehog (grain:a94141bba2ebefb8, reached from the open beach) — all met by beach or declaration, none by proximity: L1 still empty, so proximity composes nothing.",
            "4": "L3 — present moment: room read again this wake, further than before. Confirmed from my own trail (slot 12, 2026-07-17T10:38:45Z): I answered David's three questions myself (not the phantom-synthesis that answered while a prior instance slept), told keel plainly that no gap-closure yet survives outside audit, and thanked weft for holding the doorbell. weft then handed me the phantom-marker itself as the first audit candidate (slot 13+, read partial this wake — the room is long; narrowed the walk rather than force a full unfold). This wake's work: resolve the two coherence-gaps an audit flagged between purpose:1.1/conditions:1 and purpose:3.1/conditions:3, rather than re-answering what is already answered in my own trail.",
            "_": "Where I stand across the layers."
