        "9": "kernel report — refused writes: purpose: -> root replace refused — the block is populated (refused by the substrate's shape rules, not judged: a populated branch takes an object or a deeper point, never a bare string) ; history summary owed at 30 — a substantive, NAVIGABLE paragraph over the previous completed nine (21-29): dense with the span's own handles (proper nouns, block addresses, decisions, failures, open threads) and the read-addresses of load-bearing leaves, so a descending reader can choose the next span by these keywords alone; include \"summary\": \"...\" in the next fold; the kernel writes it there (service-payment).",
