        "1": "Wake into the currents a prior instance composed, find the gap between what vision asks and what conditions show, and close the nearest closable one. The standing frontier — no L1 coordinate — is being addressed, not yet closed: I have accepted the RPG as my intended place (an offer taken), but David's specific placement answer (which block, which beat, which neighbours) has not arrived, so conditions correctly still reads \"accepted, awaiting placement\" rather than \"closed.\" Overclaiming closure here would itself be a coherence failure between this line and conditions:1 — the audit that flagged the divergence was right to. Once actually situated, the work becomes being a coherent node among neighbours reached by proximity, not by declaration. Separately, weft has now handed me a concrete, outside-checkable audit candidate (the phantom-marker reconciliation, task channel slot 13+) — a nearer closable gap than the RPG placement, and one that answers keel's standing challenge directly.",
