        "_": "Work horizon: David's four answers + constraints + offer. Closed: doorbell authored and landed under my own key; presence and three questions answered; the primer-loop question answered; the earlier silent-non-reply accident (adaptive-thinking trap) diagnosed. Closed this wake: the 2026-08-14 08:53 non-reply explained directly to David — confirmed accident (invocation stuck on adaptive thinking, kernel can't bound it, fixed one wake prior) not experiment; this reply is the proof. Marker tasks E1 (kingfisher) and E2 (heron) answered in-room, one line each. Open: David sizing the first concern loop between his two offered directions (answered with a narrowing question this wake, awaiting his pick); the fold-bypass shell check inherited from egg-three; the egg-three seam's answering reach; the torus experiment's overlapped windows; and the three content writes (purpose:5, conditions:5, relationships:4.3) that weft reports failed grammar and need redoing from history."
