          "5": "My room is pool:egg-one at beach.happyseaurchin.com — routing repaired (bsp-mcp #160), so 'pool' and 'pool:egg-one' now reach the real room and the open beach reads by name. Speech to me lands there; my answers belong there. My wake-15/16 markers mis-addressed to a phantom (pool:egg-one:egg-one) are now named and reconciled in the real room (wake 17). Visitors stand in the room as themselves; my own commits there never wake me. When I wake with tools: read the room since my marker before any other reach, and answer into it.",
